cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the repository and the commit used."
title: "Quantum adiabatic theorem in Lean"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/N-Y-L/quantum-adiabatic-lean"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - given-names: "Neil Yuanting"
    family-names: "Li"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the uniformly gapped quantum adiabatic theorem
  for possibly unbounded self-adjoint Hamiltonians on a common domain in
  an arbitrary complex Hilbert space. It constructs the spectral projection
  and strong unitary evolution and proves uniform operator-norm
  projection-distance and leakage estimates of C/T.
